00:19:53.610 --> 00:19:55.090
But a fight's a fight.

00:19:55.770 --> 00:19:56.070
Wha?

00:19:56.350 --> 00:19:58.920
But I, I dreamt you.

00:19:59.100 --> 00:19:59.320
Hmm?

00:20:00.540 --> 00:20:02.540
It's time to fight, so clam up.

00:20:03.136 --> 00:20:06.436
Renamon, walk all over him.

00:20:06.844 --> 00:20:09.244
Will Takato learn to be a good Digimon tamer?

00:20:09.244 --> 00:20:12.044
Or will he lose Gilmon in a battle before he even gets to know him?

00:20:12.044 --> 00:20:14.844
Find out on the next Digimon Digital Monsters!
